      "bullets": [
        "Structure iterative prompts using Socratic dialogue or Feynman technique simulations to challenge and validate your conceptual understanding.",
        "Cross-reference generated explanations against primary documentation, source code, or research papers to catch hallucinated edge cases.",
        "Implement local RAG pipelines over reference textbooks or custom system prompts to generate targeted synthetic quizzes for active recall."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
